      {
        "author_name": "Sarah Jane Devoe",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111863841933913929429/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2EjtDqvsmeQsAwk5xIPkNDBdZBc7kO1CpsMWucObFhIiunkRF=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Workout classes, mommy get togethers, and great protein juice. Also friendly, informative staff. I have read other reviews and would like to say that stopping in for a princess peach far exceeds health benefits in comparison to stopping at other known drink chains for high calorie lattes, 'smoothies', etc. As some one who works in the military I can say that the drinks here are far more nutritional than what you are buying on the daily or putting into your body.",
        "time": 1759755080,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andy Cook",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105082920700601196872/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWF3z06tpg_33aaZBpcIemWMOQtqTHYudSKGX2tS7hENZDJuurOOA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Great new business with great management and staff! Nice to finally have a low calorie,low sugar drink option in the area. All powders and ingredients are out in the open on the bar and you can ask questions about them. They use water for all their drinks NOT milk,so this is a nice clean alternative.\nProtein shakes,tea bombs, coffees AND children sizes also! If you are in the area of Vaudreuil you MUST stop by here for a drink!",
        "time": 1615668380,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Isabelle Derry",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103207713902719611956/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJVaX2tJtX6ackfYXi3nzk6iOMlO3Ctrn_IOml1wDmiS0y1nQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Delicious healthy nutritious shakes & tea bombs!! So many different flavors. Staff is very friendly. Menu options for kids. Love this place! Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1616099040,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Valerie Margaret Jensen",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109374887141196045617/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWB9EqUfPXBifq7_DkbenxfQJSy8NdyB2SgT9SgUBoh6x1DxRGs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Love coming here! Victoria always asks me how I’m doing and takes the time to catch up! Makes it feel like family:) Oh and the drinks are 💣🤩🫶",
        "time": 1721147874,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Leigh-ann Killin",
